  {
    "name": "concern_report",
    "description": "Report the outcome of one of the user's concerns (a to-do of kind concern, see todo_list kind concern) and close it: main conversation only. Call it in the same reply in which you tell the user the outcome, with report the words you told them, faithfully; it is kept on the concern as a decision of source reported (shown in the app, sent to extensions). It is the only way a concern closes: nothing closes one on its own, and todo_complete refuses it. Report only an outcome the user has actually been told; if the concern is not settled yet, leave it open. A concern the user reopens needs another report.\n\nWrite newly generated user-facing arguments, such as titles, reasons, criteria and messages, in English unless the user requests another language or the field requires source wording. Preserve quoted source text, identifiers, tool and parameter names, enum values and command prefixes exactly. Language does not change approval requirements or permission boundaries.",
